{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PassthroughSubject"},{"type":"text","text":" does not retain the most recent value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Iterator"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/init()"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(completion:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Completion"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Subscribing","text":"Subscribing","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a ","type":"text"},{"code":"for try await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" loop over the subject","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. From then on, every value sent is buffered for that consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until it is consumed, so a consumer that is slower than the sender still sees every value, in order.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Values sent while there are no subscribers are discarded; they are never replayed to a later consumer.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starting a "},{"code":"Task","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that iterates the subject does not mean it has subscribed yet. If values must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be missed, wait until the consumer has subscribed before sending, for example with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let subject = PassthroughSubject<Int>()","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(0) \/\/ No subscribers yet, so this value is discarded.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(1)","subject.send(2)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject.swift#L41","fileName":"PassthroughSubject.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"externalID":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","title":"PassthroughSubject","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}]},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PassthroughSubject"},{"text":" does not